---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;

// Demo article data - in production, this comes from Astro content collections
const article = {
  slug: 'best-vibrators-2024',
  title: 'Best Vibrators of 2024 — Honest, In-Depth Reviews',
  description: 'After testing 50+ vibrators over 6 months, here are our top picks for every budget and experience level.',
  category: 'Vibrators',
  categorySlug: 'vibrators',
  featuredImage: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571771894821-ce6d8902fecd?w=1200&q=80',
  publishedAt: '2024-01-15',
  author: 'The Review Team',
  content: `
    <p>After six months and over 50 vibrators tested, we've narrowed it down to the ones that actually deliver. No gimmicks, no hype — just honest testing from our team.</p>
    <h2>How We Test</h2>
    <p>Every vibrator is tested by at least two team members over a minimum of four weeks. We test on different body types, different preferences, and different experience levels. We rate on: power, noise level, battery life, ease of cleaning, and value for money.</p>
    <h2>Our Top Pick: Womanizer Pro 40</h2>
    <p>The Womanizer Pro 40 remains our gold standard. The air pulse technology is unmatched — it provides consistent, powerful stimulation without any direct contact. At $199, it's not cheap, but the build quality and performance justify the price tag.</p>
    <h3>Pros</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Exceptional air pulse technology</li>
      <li>12 intensity levels</li>
      <li>Quiet operation</li>
      <li>Waterproof</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Cons</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Premium price point</li>
      <li>Battery life could be better</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Best Budget: Satisfyer Curvy 1+</h2>
    <p>If $199 is out of reach, the Satisfyer Curvy 1+ delivers 90% of the experience at less than a third of the price. The air pulse technology is nearly identical to Womanizer's — because Satisfyer actually invented it. The main differences are in the casing and battery life.</p>
    <h2>Verdict</h2>
    <p>Your choice depends on budget. If you can afford the Womanizer Pro 40, get it. If not, the Satisfyer Curvy 1+ is an excellent alternative that won't disappoint.</p>
  `,
  affiliateLinks: [
    { platform: 'Amazon', url: 'https://amazon.com/dp/B07Q3R7W5B', anchorText: 'Womanizer Pro 40' },
    { platform: 'Amazon', url: 'https://amazon.com/dp/B07XKXLV92', anchorText: 'Satisfyer Curvy 1+' },
  ]
};
---

<ArticleLayout
  title={article.title}
  description={article.description}
  category={article.category}
  categorySlug={article.categorySlug}
  featuredImage={article.featuredImage}
  publishedAt={article.publishedAt}
  author={article.author}
  affiliateLinks={article.affiliateLinks}
>
  <Fragment set:html={article.content} />
</ArticleLayout>